# The virtualenv. Recreate with the two committed wheels:
#   py -m venv venv
#   .\venv\Scripts\pip install shel_newsgateway-1.3.10-py3-none-any.whl
#   .\venv\Scripts\pip install labs_journal-1.2.1-py3-none-any.whl
venv/

# Live wire capture. Grows every run (75,523 lines / 37,761 messages at the time
# this repo was initialised) and it is a session artefact, not source.
#
# ★ It is also UTF-16LE. Reading it as UTF-8 or cp1252 returns ZERO parseable
# messages and looks like an empty log, which is how it sat unexamined. The
# committed fixtures in tests/fixtures/ are UTF-8 so they cannot repeat that.
news.log
*.log

# Secrets. Never commit either.
.env
secrets.json

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
# Runtime state. The watchlist is the tickers pasted on ONE morning (the staged
# copy was 2026-08-18, still carrying a ZZZZ test ticker and library counts from
# the day before), and hits/ and pending/ are per-run artefacts. Every one of
# these directories is created on demand by cli.py, listener.py and
# watchlist.py, so nothing needs a placeholder.
earnings_scraper/state/
